## Anti-regression invariants future build phases must hold

- **Never hand-edit AIDE-owned site files** — `.aide/docs/` and `.claude/*` are written only by aide tools via `/aide:upgrade`.
- **No invented page copy** — architect and orchestrator never author user-facing wording for /observer; it is derived from brain research and stated as such in the brief.
- **No per-file git process:** version-history facts come from the one-per-build history read (#46).
- New commits are authored as aidemd <npm@aidemd.dev> (repo-local config); never commit as the personal account or change the global git config.

